    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01BZHwSgnGAC4LTh4wgvYJsE?thread=cmsg_01BZHwSgnGAC4LTh4wgvYJsEJednwGwKMDB1BiJTjNfxLK)_\n\nAdds `.config/listening/PLAN.org`, the plan for a listening list built from vulpea album notes and Last.fm history, and links it from `README.org`.\n\nThe plan covers:\n- Importing the RYM/Bandcamp `.md` wishlists into `album` notes.\n- A small Python script that caches scrobbles and finds fully listened albums (every track in one session) and partial listens.\n- An `sp-listening` Emacs module that writes `first-listened`, prompts for ratings on partial listens, and shuffles the queue.\n- A `sync` command with a beets source now and a Navidrome source later. It uses a `beets-alternatives` target, then libgpod on Linux or Music/Finder on macOS for the stock-OS iPod.\n\nDocs only, nothing is built yet. The plan is a draft for review before step 1 starts.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01BTsYhS2AiM2jwu2CYD5nMu)_",
